    "stub_entries_note": "All 42 BL sites resolved from the retained source ELF: 10 via .symtab FUNC entries and 3 via .rel.plt -> .dynsym (sqrt, textdomain, isatty). model is call-site because the intercepted address is the BL instruction inside the mapped blob; the callee bodies are outside the extracted window. Stub grouping is semantic: camera state/capture calls to 'camera', gp_log to 'libgphoto', HI_LOG_Print/sqrt/textdomain/isatty to 'os', timediff_now/delayTime to 'timer', cb_arg_run to 'callback'.",
    "observed_behaviour": {
      "mode": "arm",
      "instructions_executed": 275,
      "result": "memory_fault",
      "error": "Invalid memory read (UC_ERR_READ_UNMAPPED)",
      "fault_address": "0x102090",
      "stub_calls_recorded": 21,
      "stub_calls_seen": {
